<title>SWEDEN: Nordbanken economic forecasts for Sweden.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken economic forecasts for Sweden.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The latest enonomic forecasts for Sweden from Nordbanken released on Thursday (in percentage change unless otherwise stated).</p>
<p>				   1997	1998    1999</p>
<p> CPI, yr average		0.9	 2.4	2.7</p>
<p> Industrial production	3.5	 4.6	5.0</p>
<p> Open unemployment	    7.9	 7.0	6.5</p>
<p> Total unemployment	  12.8	12.2     11.1</p>
<p> Borrowing need (Bln SKR)     5	  34	 -3</p>
<p> Trade balance (Bln SKR)    138	 161	181</p>
<p> Current account (Bln SKR)   69	  92	119</p>
<p> GDP				2.1	 3.2	 3.3</p>
<p> Private consumption	  1.8	 2.2	 2.9</p>
<p> Offentlig konsumtion	-0.2	-0.7	-0.4</p>
<p> Gross investments	    0.0	 3.6	 4.6</p>
<p> Stock investments	    0.0	 0.5	 0.3</p>
<p> Export			   5.6	 7.3	 7.2</p>
<p> Import			   3.1	 5.6	 6.7</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
